/// known-gap: interp says unknown identifier d instead
/// `repeat N as name` is an error with a clear message: a count has no
/// items to name. The pass number is in `idx`.
repeat 2
    say(idx)
xx
attempt
    repeat 3 as d
        say(d)
    xx
rescue e
    say(:has("{e}", "a count has none to name"))
xx
